    <briefdescription>
<para>Hot-plug filesystem monitor for automatic plugin discovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Monitors a directory for plugin file changes using platform-native APIs:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Linux: inotify</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Windows: ReadDirectoryChangesW</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>macOS: FSEvents or kqueue</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: All methods are thread-safe </para>
    </detaileddescription>
